  "description": "Cross-platform RDL/RDLC report rendering engine — run SQL Server Reporting Services (SSRS 2005) report definitions without a report server on Linux, macOS, Windows, and containers. SkiaSharp-based rendering, Native-AOT-compatible. Renders to PDF, HTML, MHTML, CSV, Excel, and images. Targets .NET 8 and .NET 10. Fork of Majorsilence Reporting (Apache-2.0) with ReportViewer-compatible rendering of mixed run formatting and last-line overflow.",
